Package: plasgenomicsutilsR
Title: Utilities for Visualizing Plasmodium Genomics Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Nicholas", "Hathaway", email = "nickjhathaway@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of utilities for visualizing and analyzing the outputs
    of Plasmodium genomics post processing (IBD analysis, Fws within-host
    diversity, and related summaries produced by the companion Python package
    plasgenomicsutils). Reference-genome facts are namespaced by species so the
    tools generalize beyond Plasmodium falciparum.
